---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /archive/
title: Archive
description: Android apps Shekhar Kumar Gupta built and published between 2014 and 2016.
---
<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">← Home</a></p>
  <header class="section-head">
    <h1>Archive: 2014–2016</h1>
    <p class="muted">The Android apps from the first version of this site. They're no longer on the Play Store, but they're where I learned to ship.</p>
  </header>
  <ul class="grid">
    {%- for a in archive %}
    <li class="tile archive-tile">
      <img src="{{ a.image }}" alt="{{ a.title }} screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="900" height="650">
      <h2 class="h3">{{ a.title }} <span class="muted small">{{ a.year }}</span></h2>
      <p>{{ a.text }}</p>
      {%- if a.repo %}<p><a class="text-link" href="{{ a.repo }}">Source on GitHub ↗</a></p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
